Plots (3x3 pits from --origin, default 40,40; z 0..2; 3 dry squares between pits; site rect origin-(2,2) .. +46 x 9):
  T5   x0    12 notches, brim-full (6 m)     T10  x6    22 notches, brim-full (11 m)     CTRL x12   6 notches, brim-full (3 m)
