Rows (item WATER_ART_CANDIDATES_BUILD_WHAT_HE_APPROVED):
  A1_FIVE_METRES_NAVY        A1. T5 centre tint == 1 AND the CTRL (3 m) centre tint == 0 (the can-fail control: the
